SRR14119317	PRJNA718861	SRP312918	SAMN18577307	SRX10489657	Homo sapiens	H9263MLN	H9263MLN	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM5221395: H9263MLN Homo sapiens RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Tumor tissue was lysed in TRIzol reagent with RNA isolated following manufacturers instructions. RNA-seq libraries were prepared using theNEBNext Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina (catalog E7530L). Briefly, 500 ng total RNA was used to isolate mRNA with the NEB Next Oligo dT Magnetic Isolation Module (catalog E7490L). The isolated mRNA undergoes fragmentation, priming, cDNA synthesis and end repair/dA-tail. Individual index primers for multiplexing were added during PCR library enrichment after adaptor ligation.	16485149	824257450	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR141/017/SRR14119317/SRR14119317.fastq.gz	9be0b93f18c5591ae88e76640420c627	453644199
